# 7. AMBULANCE AND EMERGENCY WORKFLOW

Create a separate Ambulance Dashboard.

The ambulance must authenticate through its Ambulance ID and registered personnel credentials.

### Ambulance registration form

Fields:

- Ambulance ID.
- Ambulance Registration Number.
